the α-orbit, the tripod at the branch point `b₂`, the arms, the level-1 arm pairs, the
`u`-pairs and the PB1 chains.  Angles are written in the normal form `qq p N = p/N`.

Generated by `Submission/Work/ELPull/gen_cert.py`; the checks are in `Cert/Checks.lean`.
-/
